# Object Pascal (Delphi): Delphi Language Guide (RAD Studio 12); requirements/languages/pascal.md
name     pascal delphi pas objectpascal

keyword  and array as asm begin case class const constructor destructor dispinterface
keyword  div do downto else end except exports file finalization finally for function goto if
keyword  implementation in inherited initialization inline interface is label library mod nil not
keyword  object of or out packed procedure program property raise record repeat resourcestring set
keyword  shl shr string then threadvar to try type unit until uses var while with xor
keyword  abstract cdecl deprecated dynamic external final forward helper overload override platform
keyword  private protected public published reference reintroduce safecall sealed static stdcall
keyword  strict virtual operator
type     Boolean ByteBool WordBool LongBool Byte ShortInt SmallInt Word Integer Cardinal
type     LongInt LongWord Int64 UInt64 NativeInt NativeUInt Char AnsiChar WideChar AnsiString
type     WideString UnicodeString ShortString RawByteString Real Single Double Extended Currency Comp
type     Pointer PChar PAnsiChar PWideChar Variant OleVariant
builtin  True False Self Result Abs Assigned Break Chr Continue Copy Dec Delete Dispose
builtin  Exclude Exit FillChar Halt High Include Inc Insert Length Low New Odd Ord Pos Pred ReadLn Round
builtin  SetLength SizeOf Sqr Sqrt Succ Trunc WriteLn
fold-case

line-comment   //
block-comment  { }
block-comment  (* *)
string   ' '  : doubled
number        : no-leading-dot
operators  +-*/=<>:@^
calls
hook     pascal
